<title>UK: Eurofima sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up coupon bond was announced by lead manager Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON    *5.00	MATURITY    29.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.71    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *RISING TO 7.375 PERCENT FOR LAST FOUR YEARS.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK/CH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
